title: "Vision: From Photon to Mind"
abstract: "A reference walk through vision in three parts, from the absorption of a single photon to the edge of the eye: human ocular anatomy and physiology, the physics of light, and comparative and evolutionary vision. It shows why vision is confined to a narrow window fixed by physics, and ends at the optic disc, the threshold to the central visual pathway."
